{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-05-24 13:05:00', 'title': "DAVE GALBREATH SELECTED TO LEAD COMERICA BANK'S FLORIDA MARKET", 'text': "BOCA RATON, FLA. , MAY 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMERICA INCORPORATED\xa0(NYSE: CMA) ANNOUNCED THAT DAVE GALBREATH HAS BEEN NAMED ITS FLORIDA MARKET PRESIDENT, REPLACING DAVID KUNIK, WHO HAS DECIDED TO STEP DOWN SO HE CAN FOCUS MORE DIRECTLY ON MANAGING THE MARKET'S RETAIL OPERATIONS."}